Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.43,0:00:54.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（特别行动组训练站 阿拉斯加）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.53,0:02:00.88,Title,0,0,0,0,,《谍影重重4》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.82,0:02:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦敦有个记者 叫西蒙·罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a reporter in London named Simon Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.06,0:02:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我们拦截到一些不利于我们的电话记录 发现了他的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}We caught some phone chatter we didn't like and his name came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.87,0:02:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经派去一小队去那儿监视他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They put a team out there to take a better look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直在昼夜不停紧盯着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been sitting on him pretty tight all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.25,0:02:25.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马里兰州 贝塞斯达）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.14,0:02:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在一小时前接到电话 我们有大麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got a call about an hour ago. We got a real problem here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.51,0:02:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的麻烦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.88,0:02:33.02,Title,0,0,0,0,,这个人是《卫报》的一名作者\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy's a writer for The Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.18,0:02:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正在准备一篇关于杰森·伯恩 绊脚石和黑石楠计划的报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's preparing an exposé on Jason Bourne, Treadstone and Blackbriar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.69,0:02:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么搞到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sourced how?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.09,0:02:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,从伯恩哪？怎么可能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Bourne? Is it possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.13,0:02:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确信？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.99,0:02:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们6个星期前在莫斯科见过伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had Bourne six weeks ago in Moscow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带伤徒步 被一整编队伍追杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was on foot, wounded, with a full Cossack posse up his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.87,0:02:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道他是怎么逃走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow, he walked out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.10,0:02:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在对可能性没有概念了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've kind of lost my perspective on what's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.07,0:03:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来很疲倦 艾斯拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound tired, Ezra.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.44,0:03:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是你至少会尝试着去处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would make more of an effort if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.71,0:03:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好歹是美国中央情报局的局长\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the director of the Central Intelligence Agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.18,0:03:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在上帝的份上 那就表现得像样点\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the United States of America, for God's sake. Act like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.72,0:03:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我出处理这件事 马克 再出什么错\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I go down for this, Mark, if this goes any more wrong…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.69,0:03:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾斯拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezra,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.19,0:03:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,老子给你配了一辆法拉利 你的人却像割草机一样对待\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were given a Ferrari and your people treated it like a lawn mower.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.06,0:03:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己搞砸的事 自己擦屁股 这是常理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You break it, you bought it. It was ever thus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.73,0:03:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 或许我该直接找瑞克·拜尔谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe I should be speaking directly to Ric Byer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.14,0:03:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 你已经摊上够多麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. You're in enough trouble already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.60,0:03:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让他知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll let him know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.51,0:03:56.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（弗吉尼亚州 雷斯顿）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.81,0:05:10.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（国家化验研究所 华盛顿）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.51,0:05:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱莉 就这些了吗 好极了 多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julie, is that the last of them? Terrific, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.78,0:05:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是绊脚石的最后命令？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the last audit on Treadstone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.54,0:05:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 第三页\N{\fnArial\fs30}Third page.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,七周前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.15,0:05:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是中央情报局的还是我们的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is from the CIA, or this is ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.02,0:05:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 他们的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. It's theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.55,0:05:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一堆都是他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole pile is theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.29,0:05:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在读战报吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anybody reading these ground cables?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.69,0:05:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得到了多少机密？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, how wide are we digging?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.16,0:05:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,「得到多少」什意思？把所有的资料都给我拿来就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "how wide?" Just get me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.43,0:05:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,绊脚石 黑石楠 成果拉斯等所有计划行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treadstone, Blackbriar, Outcome, LARX. All the beta programs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.26,0:05:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有都要带回翡翠湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that means take it all the way back to Emerald Lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.07,0:05:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要所有转换的要点 我想要所有人的研究结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want all points of convergence, I want all research personnel,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.30,0:05:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要知道任何人 任何时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know about anybody who talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.37,0:05:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈论的任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}to anybody about anything at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.67,0:05:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 谁看过伯恩的资料？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, has anybody looked at this stuff on Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.91,0:05:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,资料里所述简直不可思议\N{\fnArial\fs30}The field reports. It's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.38,0:05:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,遗弃三年的计划还运作着 第一代实验对象 还在活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three years off-program, non-med, first-gen, still rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.02,0:05:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我么能从中得到什么信息么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's any way we can score some data off of this…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.39,0:06:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人见他还活着么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they caught him alive…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.89,0:06:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他肯定有个基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, even as a base line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.19,0:06:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even forensically.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.73,0:06:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能你参加错了会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're in the wrong meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.30,0:06:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 我们现在的会议是关于传染病的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the meeting that we're having is about an infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.80,0:06:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在会议上讨论了一种严重的传染病\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here talking about a serious infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.30,0:06:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都想知道 它到底传播了多大范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all we're trying to do is determine how far it's spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.27,0:06:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,目的是想知道 我们还要消磨多少耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that we know how much we have to cut to save the patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.14,0:06:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从没听过绊脚石？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have never heard of Treadstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.81,0:06:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有伯恩 我不管他们有没有把他装进袋子里扔到路边\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Bourne… I don't care if they bag him and drop the body on the sidewalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.15,0:06:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也不会去管这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going to touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.65,0:06:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在把你的精力从那上面挪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to turn off that side of your head now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.48,0:06:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我们一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get with the rest of us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.95,0:06:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在考虑的事的重要性不该放在这上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're going to start to consider the magnitude of what we're facing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.45,0:06:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果危机波及到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}if this moves sideways on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.52,0:06:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该收集证据 在多挖掘点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if we get into this, we dig around,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.76,0:06:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,找出那些CIA的蠢货留下的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we find out these CIA clowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.16,0:06:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,绊脚石搞砸了剩下的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}have let this Treadstone mess metastasize into the rest of these programs?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.77,0:06:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望 还没发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just pray that that doesn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.86,0:07:32.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伦敦 滑铁卢车站）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚从伦敦 滑铁卢火车站得到消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just getting reports coming in now from Waterloo Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.32,0:07:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那发生一起枪击事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}that there has been a shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.03,0:07:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们一起去现场问下杰瑞米·汤普森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take you live down there and speak to Jeremy Thompson.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰瑞米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeremy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.23,0:07:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,滑铁卢车站仍旧一片骚乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still an awful lot of confusion here at Waterloo Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.30,0:07:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如你所见 救护车就在现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see, ambulances have been called up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.80,0:07:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,死者是西蒙·罗斯 一名退伍的战地记者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The victim, Simon Ross, was a veteran reporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦敦卫报报导\N{\fnArial\fs30}with The Guardian newspaper in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.51,0:08:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,受害者被宣告当场死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was pronounced dead at the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.14,0:08:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方告知我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police are now telling us there was at least one,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.88,0:08:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少有一个或许三个人开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and possibly as many as three, shots fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.98,0:08:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,西蒙·罗斯 一名卫报的记者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simon Ross, a reporter with The Guardian newspaper…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.52,0:08:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 詹姆士 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, James.- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.39,0:08:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不好意思 我不知道我正往回走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit, sorry. I didn't know I was coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:09:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉希尔科特博士我在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you tell Dr. Hillcott I'm here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.62,0:09:07.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（斯特森·莫兰塔公司）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.78,0:09:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.92,0:09:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.60,0:09:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea he was coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.83,0:09:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是6号 - 是第6号？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Number Six. - Number Six?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.57,0:09:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,七月之后我们就没见过他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't seen him since July.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.57,0:09:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm-hmm. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要建立新的基本数据 胆碱和神经传导数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Need new base panels, choline profile, nerve conduction."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.01,0:09:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要进行完整地移植诊断\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a full engraftment workup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.71,0:09:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会联系国家分析小组 确认是否能被授权\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna call NRAG and see if we can't get approval to put him under.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.81,0:09:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要抽取他的骨髓和完整的脊髓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a marrow and a full spinal while we have him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.02,0:09:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.19,0:10:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多废了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's prepped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.63,0:10:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他等着的时候记得让他喝点水\N{\fnArial\fs30}He drank a half-liter of water while he was waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.30,0:10:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年他肾脏出过问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had some renal issues last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.87,0:10:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 可能他渴了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe he was thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.11,0:10:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请求再化验一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a pending task request.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道 我看过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.45,0:10:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保我完成了皮质研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to complete my cortex study.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.18,0:10:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对比静脉注射 他能保持更加稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll get a more sustained contrast off an IV.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.85,0:10:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不同意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm approved?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.35,0:10:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,额\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.36,0:10:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,太感谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.89,0:10:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 让你久等了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.40,0:10:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有段时间没见你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't seen you in awhile.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.97,0:10:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以得让你做个全面检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we're going to be doing a full spec workup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.80,0:10:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个月前刚做过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just had a full spec three months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.84,0:10:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们修改了时间表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, we had to change the boundary schedules.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.48,0:10:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,而就新标准而言 你已经迟了一个礼拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're a week over the new line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.04,0:10:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,直说吧 我要是10天前早来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get this straight, if I had come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.65,0:10:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是什么事都没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 days ago, I would have been in the clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.08,0:10:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是就不会这样拖时间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It never gets any longer, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.05,0:11:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得把那个摘掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to take that off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.94,0:11:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 我很荣幸向大家介绍一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, I have the honor of introducing the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将介绍我们的贵宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is going to introduce our guest of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.24,0:11:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特 这是阿尔伯特·赫希博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bert? Doctor Albert Hirsch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.98,0:12:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我初遇丹·希尔科特是在1987年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I first met Dan Hillcott in 1987…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.99,0:12:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一场绝对是有史以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}at what must have been the most boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.13,0:12:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,最无聊的神经心理学研讨会上\N{\fnArial\fs30}neuropsych conference ever held.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.43,0:12:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离开了那无聊的会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}We managed to escape that dreary ballroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.17,0:12:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个黑暗的角落喝了一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and find a dark corner and a cold beverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.40,0:12:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,此后 我们乐此不彼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we've been finding dark corners ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.02,0:12:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 真逗\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.13,0:12:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪找到这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you find this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Youtube上\N{\fnArial\fs30}YouTube.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.80,0:12:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为每件事都做的很保密呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we had everything firewalled.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.47,0:12:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得也应该是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.57,0:12:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍旧觉得CIA会插手绊脚石\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then again, I thought the CIA would handle Treadstone,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:12:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我觉得我在兜圈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}so maybe I'm just behind the curve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.07,0:12:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就知道这些吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, is that it? Is that all of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.21,0:13:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是 显然他们认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. They apparently thought it was Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.41,0:13:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个东西联系在一起是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to attend about a half a dozen of these things together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.38,0:13:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,又能证明什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proving what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.55,0:13:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在监视绊脚石的医药部主管和他们的成果计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking at the medical directors of Treadstone and Outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.32,0:13:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,公开庆祝他们的成果\N{\fnArial\fs30}publicly celebrating their top secret man-crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.16,0:13:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果伯恩的肮脏事让绊脚石暴漏 他们会把 赫希赶出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this Bourne mess exposes Treadstone, they will turn Hirsch inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.93,0:13:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会一直告诉希尔科特直到我们了解情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be talking to Hillcott before we even know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.66,0:13:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么损失？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the damage?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.83,0:13:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,收割计划吧 我丢掉收割计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outcome. We'd lose Outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.34,0:13:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, meaning what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,意味着我们将会失去计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning we will burn the program to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.37,0:13:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是陷入谷底\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I mean from top to bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.31,0:13:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为这个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.75,0:13:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们是朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they're friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.48,0:13:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那两个家伙是我们的顶头上司啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}These two guys built our platform!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想在CNN上看到这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to wake up and see this on CNN?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.42,0:13:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 瑞克 这算什么事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Ric. Just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.99,0:13:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫希 和 希尔科特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hirsch and Hillcott?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多人认识他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people even understand this work,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.86,0:13:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管他们让他们被抓好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}let alone have the will to pursue it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.53,0:13:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是还没到这一步吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing has even happened yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.20,0:13:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须先做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we have to get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.53,0:13:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.44,0:14:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.77,0:14:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并没有失去全部 手里还有技术 数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't lose it all, we've got the science. We'll keep the data.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.34,0:14:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们J组人联系还是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of our JSOK liaisons seem to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把b计划隐秘起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got the beta programs tucked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.25,0:14:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,假装重新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take a pause, and we'll rebuild it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.42,0:14:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望有更好的选择 可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish there was a better alternative, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.46,0:14:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.13,0:15:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想包庇让我藏你这？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to pretend you don't know I'm here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.23,0:15:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,礼貌而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just trying to be polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.18,0:15:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想那么快见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't expecting you so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.25,0:15:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来做什么？搜山？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do? Did you come over the mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.08,0:15:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直跟踪我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't they forward my position?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.35,0:15:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿着那录音两天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You beat the record by two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.59,0:15:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.06,0:15:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道那有一盘录音？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't know there was a record?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.13,0:15:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 从不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It never came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.20,0:15:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你的录音对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't your record, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.64,0:15:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人来过这儿的山\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one comes over the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.08,0:15:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 就我一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.98,0:15:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便告诉你 我是亚伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Aaron, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.51,0:15:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么那么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.71,0:15:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没日没夜的 为什么冒这个险？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you weren't on the clock, why take the risk?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.35,0:15:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这山上干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why take the mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.22,0:16:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丢掉了我的药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my chems.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.82,0:16:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丢了所有东西 这就是原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dropped my program kit, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.36,0:16:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.53,0:16:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我叫你回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protocol is for me to call in your arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.70,0:16:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要那些重要的东西 你杀光他们了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going to want a sample pick-up. You got blood work, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 算我欠你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.37,0:16:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 现在拉过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, pull it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.30,0:16:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些家伙花了三个小时到这\N{\fnArial\fs30}The drone takes about three hours to get up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.77,0:16:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弄了点吃的 屎都风干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'll get some food started. You can dry your shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.15,0:17:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, look…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.15,0:17:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真遇到麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a real problem, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.89,0:17:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这因为我丢了我的药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came over that mountain because I lost my chems.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you taking?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.39,0:17:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天？都吃半颗绿色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daily? Phys meds, 250 green.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.66,0:17:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一颗蓝色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cognitive programs, 400 blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.20,0:17:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Define "lost."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.67,0:17:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢了 爬到20米高的悬崖上时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost. Fell into the rocks off a 20-meter cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.27,0:17:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.37,0:17:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.14,0:17:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我离开休息站之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I've had a pack of wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.41,0:17:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,后就有一群狼追着我 知道不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}on my ass since I left the drop, Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.31,0:17:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为我甩掉了它们 它们在河边追上了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I lost them, but they came at me at the river,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.98,0:17:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只好飞檐走壁爬去了山谷 我想在夜晚集合\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I took the ledge up to the ravine to try to rally out the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.62,0:17:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I chose wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.02,0:17:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在野外被捉住了 爬山不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got caught out in the open, I couldn't climb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.58,0:17:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,生火不能 我的双手都僵硬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't make a fire, my hands got stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.82,0:17:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我扔下了货\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dropped them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.32,0:17:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得在报告中把这些写下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to have to write that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.23,0:17:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 那个是你的么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, is that yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.00,0:17:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那血腥的活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blood work?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.10,0:17:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's yours, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.97,0:18:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是联系人 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a contact, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.08,0:18:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 很抱歉我那样叫你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry to call you out like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.08,0:18:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.59,0:18:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前从未见过计划里的任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never met anybody in the program before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.42,0:18:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没有过 任何人 你就像是第一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never, nobody. You're the…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你这儿有一些多余的药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you have some extra chems here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.27,0:18:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我应该给你定量分配直到明天么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not supposed to ration you out until you leave tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.67,0:18:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.64,0:18:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天吃药了没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you chem today?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.61,0:18:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只吃了绿色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Green only.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.31,0:18:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我32小时没用蓝药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't had a blue in 32 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.58,0:19:09.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（中情局潜伏机构 反恐局 纽约市）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.75,0:19:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 听清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}People, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.48,0:19:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上有一个威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have an imminent threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.85,0:19:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是美国安全紧急5级事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a national security emergency, priority level five.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.33,0:19:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是威利斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Wills.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.80,0:19:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克·拜尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ric Byer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.04,0:19:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嗯 他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Uh, he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.81,0:19:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩就在 纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne is here, in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.44,0:19:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森·伯恩在曼哈顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason Bourne is in Manhattan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.21,0:19:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.45,0:19:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着还能动 我就知道这些 我得挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's alive and mobile. That's all I have. I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.25,0:20:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friends are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.11,0:20:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.62,0:21:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得很奇怪么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think that's strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.25,0:21:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些狼 它们不会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wolves? They don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.42,0:21:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不会跟踪人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't track people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.73,0:21:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.93,0:21:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许它们不觉得你是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they don't think you're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.20,0:21:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少我们的人在那儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how many of us are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.37,0:21:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问的太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ask too many questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.54,0:21:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you don't know, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.65,0:21:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你在这儿是做什么的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you doing up here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.32,0:21:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我不是在评估你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that I'm not evaluating you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.72,0:21:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我不知道 你是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.93,0:21:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我根本就不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.33,0:21:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾经在乎过什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you ever not care?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.24,0:21:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是你在评估我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're evaluating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.07,0:21:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我销声匿迹了4天 所以我才到这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went off the grid for four days, that's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.41,0:21:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是常规检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I skipped my check-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.28,0:22:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我却在这个破烂的蛮荒之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm on this bullshit scavenger hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.65,0:22:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好笨 他们有他们的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have their reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.98,0:22:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.49,0:22:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手腕和大腿疼痛才是有理由的 但是我也不是很确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was having my wrist slapped, but now I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.33,0:22:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是在努力猜测\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still trying to figure out if you're.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是想杀了我 还是想给我一个激励的谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}supposed to kill me or give me a pep talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.13,0:22:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 你想太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, man, you think too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.63,0:22:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这不是在互相说说么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't we wired to stick our nose in, you and I?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.70,0:22:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,300英里之外才有另外一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not another person for 300 miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.47,0:22:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这附近没人在偷听 拜托 你必须得给我个话题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know nobody's listening. Come on, you've got to give me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.88,0:22:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,来聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.31,0:22:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他们把你扔在地里然后不管你了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did they pull you off the field and put you up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.28,0:22:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是什么体能训练 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not physical, with the way you've been moving, so what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.55,0:22:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,降低任务？开始为你着想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn down an assignment? Start thinking for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.66,0:22:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈恋爱了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.83,0:22:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你恋爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fell in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.82,0:23:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着这个防止狼来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better for wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.88,0:23:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,门那边儿有着个双层弹药 需要多少你就拿多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an ammo box by the door, you take as much as you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.59,0:23:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的谈话结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're done talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.69,0:23:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼来了 等着 提前开枪 就能打中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ate, you're pulling out early. You should hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.16,0:23:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.06,0:23:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 改天再聊？- 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Some othertime, then. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.90,0:23:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.90,0:24:07.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（杰森·伯恩）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.90,0:24:17.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（韩国 首尔）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.65,0:24:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.45,0:24:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹 我觉得我们需要确认一些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that we need to clarify something here, Don.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.78,0:24:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clarify what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.35,0:24:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不停的说什么不可接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep using the word "unacceptable"…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.75,0:24:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要知道你这么说到底是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I want to know exactly what you think you mean by that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.33,0:25:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可接受就是不可接受的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Unacceptable" means exactly that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.49,0:25:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢你告诉我的这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like what you're telling me,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.86,0:25:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不喜欢你说话的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like how you're telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.63,0:25:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 我们处于情报局出境任务中的一个关键时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in a critical phase on four missions, Ric.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.67,0:25:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们现在停止 损失将不可估量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The intelligence loss, if we stop now, it couldn't be quantified.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.47,0:25:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 可以估量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, actually, it could.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.67,0:25:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会回到我们开始计划之前的状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be right back to where you were before we delivered the program.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.81,0:25:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我是结果有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me there's a problem with Outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.38,0:25:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为如果那样我早就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I'd be hearing about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.01,0:25:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可没说是的 - 你什么都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't say there was. - You're not saying much of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.28,0:25:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一周一片\N{\fnArial\fs30}One pill, once a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.72,0:25:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,每8天一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every eight days.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.69,0:25:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有蓝药和绿药了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, no more blues and greens.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.12,0:25:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在过渡计划里的所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're transitioning everyone in the program.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.96,0:25:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得如何保持节食计划的方法吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember how to keep an accurate diet log?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.60,0:25:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.67,0:25:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底懂不懂第四号任务的程序？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand their full utility?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.33,0:25:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚刚将伊朗导弹计划推迟了36个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just set Iran's missile program back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.10,0:25:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在一名潜伏特工的帮助下\N{\fnArial\fs30}36 months with one deep-cover agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.84,0:25:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近2年里最好的侦查成果\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best action recon out of North Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.91,0:25:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是计划的特工执行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the last two years came from Outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.68,0:25:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我完全知道这些 - 你知道我们等待得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm fully aware of this. - Do you know how long we've waited.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.38,0:25:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个来自巴基斯坦三军情报局内部的行动需要多久么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get a real, long-term operative inside Pakistani ISI?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.35,0:26:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是叫我清理掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're asking me to wipe the most valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.12,0:26:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前收集起来用过的 最有价值的资产\N{\fnArial\fs30}intel-gathering assets we've ever put in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.39,0:26:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在快速停止这个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're shutting things down immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.39,0:26:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个偶然事件会被掩盖的完美无缺\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this contingency was covered loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.65,0:26:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我这可不是我们交流的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me this isn't why we're having this conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.65,0:26:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森·伯恩逃跑了 对不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason Bourne got away, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.96,0:26:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是根本原因 是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what this is all about, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.93,0:26:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以看见这计划里所有的行动 除了你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have visibility on every action program in the system except yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.60,0:26:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很痛恨听到我不能做这件事 不能看那件事的各种理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sick of hearing the reason I can't do something or see something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.23,0:26:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,只因为我没有得到国家研究资产的许可\N{\fnArial\fs30}is because it hasn't cleared the National Research Assay Group.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.80,0:26:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么搞定这种事情的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you pull this kind of weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.74,0:26:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹 我很爱国 和你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don, I'm a patriot, the same as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.04,0:26:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为国家流过血 就像你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bleed over this the same way you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.64,0:26:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你和我有工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you and I have our jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.35,0:27:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们有能力去做必须做的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we've got the strength to do what's necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.58,0:27:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 但是现在就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm sorry, but right now, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.54,0:28:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面跟回到凡间一样 真不爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really coming down out there. It's getting ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.41,0:28:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.52,0:28:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢你的提醒 不想再超人一步了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe I should try to get ahead of it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.52,0:28:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 太晚了 我只能逗留在此\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's too late for that. Just stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.02,0:28:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对侦查这片地区需要一些帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need some help squaring the place away, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.33,0:28:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是么 我啥也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.53,0:28:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至还需要为此开点药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already have to do that medication write-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.23,0:28:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道我是否还会解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if I want to have to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.60,0:28:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我行程的一切 你懂么\N{\fnArial\fs30}my itinerary as well, you know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.80,0:28:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心那些药 我搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about the chems, I got that covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.61,0:28:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要去看一眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.56,0:28:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听见了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hearing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.67,0:29:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在等着什么么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you expecting anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.81,0:29:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种天气 没一个提示？\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this weather, without a heads-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.24,0:29:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定在靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's definitely getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.88,0:29:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,接通了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.01,0:29:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, man, I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.28,0:29:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那东西没坏吧 - 没坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it working? - Yeah, it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.62,0:29:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,设备没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gear is fine. It's not the gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.62,0:29:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 也许是补给小组来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe it's a resupply.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.79,0:29:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们昨天来过了 怎么都没办法着陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were here yesterday, and they can't land in this, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.33,0:29:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.17,0:29:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.84,0:29:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 我们该分头行动去找找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. We should spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.54,0:29:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 我去查查大本营那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Look, I'll take the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.98,0:29:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有消息了让我知道 好不？- 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me know when you get eyes on it, Okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.14,0:30:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,国防情报 特别行动 无人机指挥中心
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.14,0:30:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要在这清除我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she gonna clear us here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.24,0:30:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得趁早解决这事儿 以免变得更糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to get above this before it gets any sloppier.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.81,0:30:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住 刚刚过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, hold on. Just, there's a…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.95,0:30:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 单机 我也看见了 两分钟后到那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy, Solo, I saw it, too. Give us a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.89,0:31:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the issue? Hang on, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.26,0:31:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 单机 正在查找资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, Solo. Sourcing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.46,0:31:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像那儿还有一个活动的信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like there's still an active signal back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.73,0:31:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.17,0:31:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你那边还是我 - 是我这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that on your end or is that… - My end.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.63,0:31:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很难进行信号交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're having a hard time getting a handshake.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.57,0:31:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 单机保持通话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, Solo. Holding on relay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.64,0:31:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你连上他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you had them linked.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.04,0:31:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们连上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.21,0:31:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标已经瞄准 精确到结构\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were lined up, all the way to the structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.34,0:31:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个目标一直都是绿色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both targets were green, all the way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.68,0:31:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 确认ID - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is there a PID? - Unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.18,0:31:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 敌人？- 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hostile? - Unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.65,0:31:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是卫星回音吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a satellite echo, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.95,0:31:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.25,0:31:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.36,0:31:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,再往回退\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's playing it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.86,0:31:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的冬天 我们得回头去了从头再来么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to wait on her. We're going to have to come around.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.10,0:31:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离燃料极限还有多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far are you from bingo fuel?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.27,0:31:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有20分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty minutes on station.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.50,0:31:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好赶得上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better get on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.85,0:32:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认 单机 我们还需要一次通过许可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Affirmative, Solo, but we're gonna need another pass here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.52,0:32:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道我们啥也看不见 是吧？发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knows we can't see shit, right? Check it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.39,0:32:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 新弹上膛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that. New profile engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.42,0:32:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're coming around now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.36,0:32:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,单机收到 东南 东\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that, Solo. East-southeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.13,0:32:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,直奔山谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming right back up the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.56,0:32:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求报告燃料状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Requesting fuel graph, say your state.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.53,0:32:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,状态30加2\N{\fnArial\fs30}State two-plus-SO to splash.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.33,0:32:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,受到 单机 燃料情况正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy, Solo. Fuel to bingo is green.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.97,0:32:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在查找目标信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sourcing target beacon now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.45,0:32:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.96,0:32:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,消失了 他去哪儿了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone. Where the hell did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.93,0:32:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说他去哪儿了 是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "Where did it go?"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.13,0:32:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,单机 我们 我们找不到那个信号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solo, we are negative on that signal here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.50,0:32:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失去了第二个信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just lost that second beacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.65,0:33:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,找不到 单机 找不到 所有的探测器和系统都是正常的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative, negative, Solo. All sensors and systems are green.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.28,0:33:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,诊断系统绿色 飞机正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diagnostics are green, aircraft is green.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.52,0:33:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有都是好的 就是找不到目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got everything but a target here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.20,0:33:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是系统的问题 探测器是好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not a system issue. Sensors are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.60,0:33:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我换到红外辐射再试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we're going to switch to IR and take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.43,0:33:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到 - 换到热辐射\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Roger. - Switching to thermal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.72,0:33:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,单机 我需要你最后一次确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solo, can I get your last confirmed…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.25,0:33:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是咋回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.35,0:33:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,红冠 我们遇到了点情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red Crown, we're getting some music.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.32,0:33:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你撞到了什么东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hit something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.59,0:33:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那么想的 红冠 你看见了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so. Red Crown, you getting this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.69,0:33:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nothing there. There is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.86,0:33:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on, here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.81,0:34:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不是坠落 那是说被击毁了 他们确定么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't just go down, it was shot down? They're sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.98,0:34:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们这样告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I was told.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.31,0:34:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁干的？用什么武器？\N{\fnArial\fs30}By who? With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.38,0:34:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.52,0:34:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时他们在追踪另一个信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were sourcing a second signal when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.16,0:35:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那时我们来不及了 我要叫人来清理这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, we didn't have time. I'm calling for clearance now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.86,0:35:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定会有人在大门等着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be someone meeting us at the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.80,0:35:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,无人驾驶飞机准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have a drone ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.97,0:35:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一架正在加油呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're fueling one now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.68,0:35:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们确定了信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}They parsed the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.92,0:35:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是亚伦·克劳斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Aaron Cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.59,0:35:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.10,0:35:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all set, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.12,0:35:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,接近方位角 距之前的方位30°\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's approach off azimuth, 30 degrees off our last pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.39,0:36:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.82,0:36:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,红冠收到 方位30° 3-0-0\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red Crown to contact. Three-zero-zero for 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.22,0:36:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 看到信号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are. There's my signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.06,0:36:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到信号 单机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signal is hot, Solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.86,0:36:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号很活跃 现在好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signal is up and live. And here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.06,0:36:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才怎么没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's that been?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.40,0:36:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓 反正现在是我的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter now. It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.86,0:36:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 单机 信号很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy, Solo. Strong signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.43,0:36:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙用的是什么武器？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of weapon system is this guy operating?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.83,0:36:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有来福枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's probably got a rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.70,0:36:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也是一高火力的来福\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a high-powered rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.41,0:36:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有多少时间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's our time frame, here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.88,0:36:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,15分钟左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen minutes, plus or minus.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.34,0:36:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在试着重新储备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to factor the storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.94,0:37:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,单机 目标静止 启动激光制导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, Solo. Target is static. Engaging laser now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.25,0:38:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.86,0:38:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.36,0:38:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.86,0:38:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.87,0:39:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,激光已启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laser armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.71,0:39:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,感应器和温度已确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sensor and thermal confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.06,0:39:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有多久？- 30秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are we? - Thirty seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.93,0:39:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该离我远点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have left me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.17,0:39:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,装配导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arming missile.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.68,0:39:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missile away.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.72,0:39:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在移动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he goes, he's moving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.02,0:39:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一会就不动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.73,0:40:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标击毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.10,0:40:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 确认攻击 目标击毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy, Solo. Kill confirmed, target destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.60,0:40:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来不错嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking good?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.64,0:40:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来 不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks good. Looks cold and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.28,0:40:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官恕我直言 现在不是那个时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect, sir, now is not the best time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.48,0:40:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,20分钟内这个地方就会毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 20 minutes, this place is going to fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.65,0:40:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我愿意冒这个险 我们需要谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm aware of that, I'll take the chance. We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.95,0:40:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止你现在在做的 回头是岸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to stop what you're doing and turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.55,0:40:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.92,0:40:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被内线坑了 行了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got screwed on the intel, Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.66,0:40:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道那里还有人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody knew those people were in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.76,0:40:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于我们要求你做的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be perfectly normal for a person to have doubts.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.83,0:40:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有不道德的怀疑是十分正常的\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the morality of what we just asked you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.97,0:40:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个问题吗 长官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a question, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.13,0:40:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 听好我要告诉你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not. Tune in to what I'm trying to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.00,0:40:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道是什么吗？食恶使者是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what a sin-eater is?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.61,0:40:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们 我们是食恶使者\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we are. We are the sin-eaters.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.11,0:40:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,意味着在这种关系中 我们把道德底线拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means that we take the moral excrement that we find in this equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.61,0:40:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且深埋在内心里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we bury it down deep inside of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.58,0:40:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样其他的损失 可以让我们独善其身\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that the rest of our cause can stay pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.78,0:40:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.45,0:41:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在道德上我们没法自我辩解 但是绝对必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are morally indefensible and absolutely necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.42,0:41:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.80,0:41:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,完事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will that be all?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.67,0:41:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,把伤口处理了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stitch that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.97,0:41:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,6小时后飞机上见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna put you on a plane to Yemen in six hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.37,0:41:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会准备好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.18,0:41:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早告诉你她会朝我们来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you she'd be coming at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.72,0:41:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 我知道 你需要保持冷静 特里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I need you to stay calm, Terry, Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.06,0:41:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就要进行参议院听证会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're giving her a Senate hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.23,0:41:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你咋能不觉得这是个问题呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you not see that as a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.03,0:41:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道伯恩 她知道黑石楠行动 她还知道 赫希\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knows Bourne, she knows Blackbriar, she knows Hirsch.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.50,0:41:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道他妈的整个行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got a handle on the whole goddamn operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.63,0:41:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不明白你咋能保持这么冷静的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see how the hell you could be so calm about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.63,0:41:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 她能说啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what can she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.17,0:41:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她能说啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.67,0:41:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她从那里出去了 然后告诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if she gets up there and she says,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.97,0:41:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,绊脚石和黑石楠计划 你就觉得那就完了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Treadstone, Blackbriar, you think that was it?"
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.08,0:41:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为杰森·伯恩是所有的秘密？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You think that Jason Bourne was the whole story?"
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.71,0:41:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 但还有很多其他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sorry, there's a lot more going on here."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.51,0:42:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她告诉他们绊脚石只是冰山一角怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if she tells them that Treadstone was just the tip of the iceberg?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.58,0:42:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 你要是非要紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you want to sweat something?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.75,0:42:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就担心收获计划吧 因为我们还在森林里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worry about Outcome, because we're still not out of the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.92,0:42:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是关于别的项目 她知道的没那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as far as our other programs, she doesn't know that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.12,0:42:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.02,0:42:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们在监视她的一言一行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're tapped into everything she says and does.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.26,0:42:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.40,0:42:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话 邮件 车 房子 律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phones, email, cars, house, lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.50,0:42:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她搭上杰森·伯恩的时候开始就已经被我们掌握了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was cooked the minute she hitched her wagon to Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.44,0:42:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她协助并怂恿了一个国际逃犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}She aided and abetted an international fugitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.34,0:42:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她阻止了我们停止一个流氓组织的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}She prevented the agency from shutting down a rogue operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.68,0:42:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她违背了所有誓言准则和条例\N{\fnArial\fs30}She violated every oath and code of conduct that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.95,0:42:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 是她把那个混蛋带进了美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Christ's sake, she brought the son of a bitch back to America.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.12,0:42:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道她的动机是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, God knows what her motives are,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.89,0:42:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 很明显 保护这个国家不是其中一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's clear that protecting this country is not one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.13,0:42:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要搁以前就是叛国了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That used to be called treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.31,0:44:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,配平方程式 然后应该得出一个常量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the solution here. Now, that should be coming up as a constant.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.81,0:44:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这呢啊 我不明白这些数据的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are. I don't understand these values…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.38,0:44:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.32,0:44:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你听见那个了吗？- 听见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you hear that? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.65,0:44:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.15,0:44:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是枪响\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.42,0:44:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不 - 不 是枪响\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. I… - No. Yeah. No, it was gunfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.06,0:45:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求你了 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please. No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.33,0:45:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.77,0:45:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门 他在向我们开枪 放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door! He's shooting us! Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.44,0:45:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门 他有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door! He's got a gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.18,0:45:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.25,0:45:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.99,0:45:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.12,0:45:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们光看着门管啥用？赶紧跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to be able to get a card!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.76,0:45:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to be able to get in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.83,0:45:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么拉？- 我们必须到后门去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's happening? - We gotta go for the back door.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.13,0:45:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁了 他可能把门锁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's locked. He locked the back door.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.90,0:45:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.03,0:45:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会杀光我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna kill us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.47,0:45:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要那样 我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.64,0:45:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.71,0:45:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在里面到处开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's shooting everyone in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.15,0:45:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要通行卡 谁有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a red lab access card! Who's got a red lab access card?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.45,0:45:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们从楼上带着一个下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're bringing one down from upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.58,0:45:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都在里面 有卡的都在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all in there. Everyone who has one is in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.61,0:46:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉里 你在哪呢？ 我需要紧急卡 现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy, where are you, man? I need a red card now!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.51,0:46:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don… What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.77,0:46:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠 他把门把手卸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, the handle's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.04,0:46:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 门把手掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The handle's off!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.91,0:47:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住 放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it! Stop! Drop the weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.48,0:47:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下 放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it! Drop the weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.63,0:48:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,调查人员仍在寻找这次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Investigators are still searching for some explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.70,0:48:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作场合谋杀事件背后的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}behind the workplace murder-suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.91,0:48:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,只留下又一个美国群体在震惊 哀痛中\N{\fnArial\fs30}that left another American community grieving and shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.41,0:48:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地警察和联邦官员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police and federal authorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.81,0:48:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在全面调查实验室的设施\N{\fnArial\fs30}were poring over the lab facility…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.65,0:48:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要见你 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boys need to see you right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.42,0:48:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要让他们马上离开那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get that Foite story out there right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.22,0:48:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会处理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.80,0:48:49.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（度戒严实验室内发生谋杀案 嫌犯杀害五名同事）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.82,0:48:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那后面的这块区域呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this area, back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.99,0:48:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经都用作仓库了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all been converted to storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.69,0:48:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,邮件发来的蓝图上不是仓库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it says on the blueprint, and even on the board, there,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.50,0:49:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是一个医学实验机构\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it's a medical examination suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.47,0:49:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 这是哪种实验？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what kind of examinations are we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.27,0:49:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 让我看下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go. May I see the hand, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.94,0:49:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 愈合的不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that has healed well.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.65,0:49:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有感觉减退的症状吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any diminished sensation?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.78,0:49:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.02,0:49:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把我放倒吗 医生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you trying to put me down, doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.19,0:49:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕你送来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid there's been a few gaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.06,0:49:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,样本有点问题 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}in your sample deliveries, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.83,0:49:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要再次确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we need a full work-up this visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.50,0:49:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来一个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.67,0:49:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,为啥？因为我丢了一滴血？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Is it 'cause I missed a blood drop?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.14,0:49:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你觉得这管用吗 医生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how do you think it works, doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.48,0:49:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些药 我们就叫暂停\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we can just call a timeout?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.68,0:49:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你取样的时候 世界都静止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything stops while you pull your samples?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.02,0:49:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么不躺下来 放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you lie down and relax?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.29,0:49:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.46,0:49:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们做的事怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think that we do out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.73,0:50:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 信息够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that's enough information.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.16,0:50:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.46,0:50:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 你就是一个医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're just a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.53,0:50:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们被监视着呢吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know we're on camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.53,0:50:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.70,0:50:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你特意打扮了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why you make such an attractive appearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.81,0:50:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 现在请从100倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, why don't you count backward from 100, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.10,0:50:35.01,Note,0,0,0,0,,（芝加哥）
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.00,0:52:08.01,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马里兰州实验室枪击案 六人死亡）
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.20,0:53:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.37,0:53:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 大门应该是开着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the gate should be open.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.34,0:53:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后左转 大概半英里远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bear to the left. It's about half-a-mile up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.30,0:54:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.90,0:54:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希林博士？ - 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dr. Shearing? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.24,0:54:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我是康妮·多德博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I'm Dr. Connie Dowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.24,0:54:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 还好吧？- 挺好的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, how are you? - Well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.04,0:54:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是特工拉里·胡珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Special Agent Larry Hooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.91,0:54:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.08,0:54:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.48,0:54:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您让我过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for letting us come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.08,0:54:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,房子真漂亮 大工程\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a remarkable property. What a project.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.65,0:54:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我实在不想讨论这房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I really don't want to talk about the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.99,0:54:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你想买下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not unless you want to buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.96,0:54:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 请坐吧 我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit, I guess. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.33,0:54:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就告诉你一声 行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you know, Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.97,0:54:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到1小时前 我完全不知道有这次见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know anything about this meeting until an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.74,0:54:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天晚上也没人说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nobody last night said to make time.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.17,0:54:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,「约个时间或挤出时间来」这样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}or pick a time, or anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.41,0:54:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后今天早上我买张飞机票去看我妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, this morning, I buy a plane ticket to see my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.91,0:54:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然周围就4级戒备状态了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and suddenly it's like DEFCON 4 around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.85,0:54:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是妄想好不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is not paranoia, Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.61,0:54:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这基本就冲我面来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is pretty much directly in my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.35,0:54:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.45,0:54:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们难道应该忽略你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we not be paying attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.29,0:54:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能让我们俩单独待会吗 拉里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you leave us alone, Larry?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.49,0:55:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.69,0:55:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚经历了及其惊骇的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've just been through an extremely traumatic experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.60,0:55:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你是学的什么 博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Doctor of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.17,0:55:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.24,0:55:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,临床心理学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clinical psychology.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.44,0:55:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. So, what do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.44,0:55:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,给间谍提供悲伤辅导？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give grief counseling to spies?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.64,0:55:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的安全级别很高 玛塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a very unusual security clearance, Marta.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.18,0:55:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该能想到 买张机票\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should expect that buying a ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.55,0:55:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,去蒙特利尔 并且不告诉任何人会引起一些警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Montreal without telling anyone would set off some bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.22,0:55:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 那我也有我自己的警惕 是把？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I've got some bells of my own going off, Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.29,0:55:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你是打算告诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, are you going to be the person who tells me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.79,0:55:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what the hell is going on here,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.56,0:55:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你也是一神秘的保姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}or are you just the next mystery babysitter?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.69,0:55:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.83,0:55:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要尝试不思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm trying to do is not think.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.60,0:55:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想停止思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just… I want to stop thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.40,0:55:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种感觉你跟别人说过吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you discussed those feelings with anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.57,0:55:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,妹妹 朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister? Friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.04,0:55:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.17,0:55:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得·博伊德呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Peter Boyd?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.54,0:55:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.54,0:55:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.24,0:55:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们什么都能说是吧？没底线？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we're into everything, is that it? Is anything off-limits here?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.58,0:55:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你读过你的就业保密合同吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever read your employment security contract?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.65,0:56:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我读过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I read my…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.59,0:56:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你再问我明不明白限制泄密的内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're asking me whether I understand my disclosure restrictions,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.82,0:56:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我有生化和\N{\fnArial\fs30}yes, I have a PhD in biochemistry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.66,0:56:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,基因病毒学的博士后奖学金\N{\fnArial\fs30}with postdoctoral fellowships in virology and genetics.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.56,0:56:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道怎么阅读\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how to read!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.16,0:56:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白的是 为什么我的同事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I don't understand is why my colleague.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.40,0:56:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然发精神病然后杀了实验室所有的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}has a psychotic episode and shot everyone in the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.44,0:56:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们在那干什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you aware of what we do in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.21,0:56:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.71,0:56:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我怎么知道你甚至明白这次谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how do I know that you're even cleared for this conversation?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.85,0:56:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有讨论过这次事件吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you discussed anything to do with the incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.95,0:56:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟任何人 除了调查员？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with anyone other than the investigators?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.55,0:56:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得·博伊德 8个月前就搬出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter Boyd moved out eight months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.59,0:56:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦但我猜你已经知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I guess you already know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.42,0:56:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没有跟他谈过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, no, I haven't spoken to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.26,0:56:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你和佛洛德博士除了工作外没有任何关系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stated that you and Dr. Foite had no relationship outside of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.46,0:56:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}None.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.53,0:56:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他公寓里有些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was material in his apartment that indicates he had.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.24,0:56:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,表明他跟你有不寻常的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}an unusual fixation with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.47,0:56:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片 日记 他们还找到几件衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Photographs, journal entries. They found several articles of clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.84,0:56:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什… 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.91,0:57:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟他曾有过任何形式的冲突吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever rebuff him in any way?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.81,0:57:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.25,0:57:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.82,0:57:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直以为他是同性恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always thought he was gay.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.49,0:57:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 没人暗示你应该为这次事件负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, no one is suggesting that you're responsible for what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.19,0:57:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 多谢啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.26,0:57:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,存活者往往会感到愧疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survivors often experience feelings of guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.23,0:57:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些感觉会被放大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those feelings can be amplified.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.40,0:57:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让你活下来的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the realization that he let you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.81,0:57:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我活下来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he let me live?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.01,0:57:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到那个视频了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen the video?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.95,0:57:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得那是事实？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think that's what it shows?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.98,0:57:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问的问题都是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are asking all the wrong questions!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.82,0:57:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该问什么 玛塔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should I be asking, Marta?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.95,0:57:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看过弗洛德博士的血液结果吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anyone looked at Dr. Foite's blood work?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.69,0:57:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看过吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have they?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.86,0:57:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 那是唯一可以解释的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that is the only thing that is going to make any sense, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.79,0:57:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}His behavior was…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.30,0:57:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 斯特森有一些项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, there are projects at Sterisyn,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.60,0:58:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,国家防御项目 可以解释为什么他做出这样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}defense projects that could explain why he did what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.24,0:58:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里的人在研究行为控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}And people there are working on behavioral design.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.34,0:58:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一种程序化的神经行为控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's programmable behavior, neural design.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.85,0:58:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你明白我告诉你的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand what I'm telling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.32,0:58:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为他受到了实验室某种东西的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he was exposed to something at the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.96,0:58:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.66,0:58:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.40,0:58:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的枪 这他妈的是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my gun. What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.70,0:58:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有潜在自杀危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a potential suicide risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.37,0:58:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等会 你怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Wait a minute. How did you…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.01,0:58:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他怎么找到的？ - 玛塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did he find that? - Marta…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.84,0:58:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 行了 这次谈话结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Okay. This meeting is now over.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.24,0:58:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你俩出去 现在 - 玛塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want you both out of here, right now! - Marta…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.48,0:58:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他在我房子里乱翻\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! He has been snooping around my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.41,0:58:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛塔 我想让你离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marta, I want to sign off here today!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.85,0:58:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你上那架飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to let you get on that plane,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.75,0:58:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你必须帮助我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you have got to help us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.69,0:58:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 我们不得不做我们的工作 好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we have got to do our job here, Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.33,0:58:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have got to go through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.36,0:59:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我走之前我需要知道你很冷静且安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know that you are calm and safe before I leave here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.20,0:59:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且我需要知道你明白所有的规则 然后你才能上飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I need to know that you understand the rules before you get on that plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.60,0:59:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 就\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, just…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.37,0:59:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐下 让我把这些问题问完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, sit down and let us get through our questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.54,0:59:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.09,0:59:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊 这是干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus! What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.72,0:59:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这他妈的是干嘛？- 准备？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell is this? - Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.09,0:59:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快好了 - 你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Close. - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.63,0:59:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.96,0:59:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.53,0:59:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在放开我 - 准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get the hell off me now! - Set!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.27,0:59:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开枪！- 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Green! - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.62,1:00:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gene!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.36,1:00:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在地下室呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}A runner in the basement!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.93,1:00:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.40,1:00:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 康妮 - 在你右边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Connie! - On your right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.62,1:00:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}One. Girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.04,1:02:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find her.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.61,1:02:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find her!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.10,1:02:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉恩 说句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gene! Talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.10,1:02:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.90,1:02:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你重新上子弹了 枪是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you reloaded, the gun is empty.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.94,1:03:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, look.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.07,1:03:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,希林博士 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Shearing, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.94,1:03:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是来伤害你的 - 你怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not here to hurt you, Okay? - How did you…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.28,1:03:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是你？- 是的 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was you! - Yes. Shh!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.75,1:03:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 你想活命吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. Do you want to live?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.66,1:03:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 你想活命吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. Do you want to live?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.29,1:03:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想活命吗？ - 想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you want to live? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.53,1:03:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 放开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Let go of this gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.86,1:03:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这怎么可能？ - 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How is this possible? - Let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.30,1:03:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.10,1:03:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.17,1:03:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你按照我说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I need you to do exactly what I say.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.70,1:03:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么会这样 - 听我说 按我说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How is this possible? - Listen to me. Exactly what I say.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.81,1:03:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白？ - 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Understand? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.98,1:03:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.32,1:04:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 博士 我需要我的表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, doc? I need my watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.83,1:04:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要我的表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, I need that watch!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.87,1:04:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,房里有摄像头吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there chems in this house?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.00,1:04:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验药物？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Program medication.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.10,1:04:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都死了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they all dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.24,1:04:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.41,1:04:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 你这儿有计划药物？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. Look at me. Do you have program medication here?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.71,1:04:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.78,1:04:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝色的 绿色的药丸 你放在哪儿了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chems. Greens, blues. Do you have them here?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.11,1:04:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 没有 - 没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no. - No?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.78,1:04:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里么？- 不 没有 这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here? No, no. - Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.02,1:04:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那在哪里 你们把药丸放哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where, then? Where do you have them?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.62,1:04:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪里？- 你们把药丸放在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - Where do you keep the chems?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.62,1:04:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.22,1:05:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,希林博士 药在哪儿？我要吃药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Shearing, where are the chems? I need the chems!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.69,1:05:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 但我不知道在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand, but I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.60,1:05:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,病毒控制不需要那些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not something… We do virology control.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.43,1:05:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这一切发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, all of that happens…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.57,1:05:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有药品\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have medication.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.61,1:05:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我有 我肯定会给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had any, I would give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.22,1:05:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.82,1:05:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只剩不到8分钟从这儿脱身 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have less than eight minutes to clear out of here, Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.46,1:05:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.99,1:05:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为下一拨闯进来的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the next thing coming through that door.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.90,1:05:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,会把我们杀光\N{\fnArial\fs30}is going to wipe us out.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.62,1:06:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,能给我讲一下那边的情况么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get a sitrep, here?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.49,1:06:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果听到了 回答我 拉里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can hear me, pick up, Larry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.16,1:06:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉里 回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry, pick up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.64,1:06:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Sorry about the tran.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.64,1:06:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划进展如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's our frame-rate, here?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.21,1:06:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,康妮说还没完 她在做收尾工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connie says about 10. Just wrapping up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.64,1:06:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么需要帮忙的就说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her we need a heads-up. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.41,1:06:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.35,1:06:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.23,1:06:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能还是你来做比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably better you did this.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.10,1:07:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.76,1:07:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼 你现在叫琼·梦露 说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}June. Your name is June Monroe, say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.97,1:07:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 琼·梦露 - 说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}- June Monroe. - Say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.20,1:07:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼·梦露\N{\fnArial\fs30}June Monroe.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.64,1:08:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 选一个你呆过的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now pick a place you lived.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.70,1:08:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最后住的地方 你熟悉的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last place you lived. A place you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.87,1:08:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贝塞斯达 - 贝塞斯达 那就是你住的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bethesda. - Bethesda, that's where you live.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.84,1:08:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人问起 你就是来自德斯坦的琼·梦露\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody asks, you're June Monroe from Bethesda.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.98,1:08:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弄丢了钱包 我载你回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost your wallet. I'm driving you home.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.45,1:08:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字是詹姆斯 詹姆斯和琼 记住了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is James. James and June, you got it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.25,1:08:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.85,1:08:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的真名么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.69,1:08:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}James?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.62,1:08:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 什么？你难道不知道我名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. What? You don't know my name?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.03,1:08:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前怎么称呼我？你在血液样本上如何做标记？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you call me? What do you put on my blood work?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.30,1:08:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,5\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.67,1:08:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,5？数字5？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five? The number five?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.30,1:08:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们见过多少次？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how many times we've met?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.21,1:08:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,13次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirteen.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.47,1:08:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去4年见过13次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirteen exams over the last four years.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.51,1:08:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是一个数字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's what I get, a number?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.74,1:08:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,5号？好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number Five. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.68,1:08:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少人中的5号？像我这样的有多少人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five of what, then? How many are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.81,1:08:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,项目志愿者？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Program participants?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.52,1:08:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这样称呼我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you call us?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.72,1:08:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,9人 还剩6人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were nine. Then six.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.32,1:08:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,志愿者？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Participants.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.66,1:08:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么找到我的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.16,1:08:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.39,1:08:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要杀掉我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going to kill all of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.53,1:08:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也别想幸免\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then just leave you guys alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.03,1:08:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你的同事只是发疯了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think your colleague just went crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.86,1:08:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这样认为？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.93,1:09:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我 我没有 - 他们把他抓走 又放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't think anything. - They wound him up and set him loose.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.07,1:09:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的 真的不知道发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really have no idea what is going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.00,1:09:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么 他们停掉了整个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on is they're shutting the whole thing down.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.71,1:09:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is "they"?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.41,1:09:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不 不知道 袭击那所房子的是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know… Who were the people at the house?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.21,1:09:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不 - 你已经问过很多问题了 好么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no, no. - You had your turn, Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.61,1:09:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我们第一次见 你就不断的给我抽血 问这问那\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been bleeding and scoping and scraping me since the day we met.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.88,1:09:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在轮到我了 该我问你问题 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my turn, now. I'm asking the questions, you got it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.29,1:09:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要计划药丸 明白？我需要计划用药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need program meds, Okay? I need program meds.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.39,1:09:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们放在哪里了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you keep the chems?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.19,1:09:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有 我已经告诉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have any. I've already told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.26,1:09:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们没有药 - 胡扯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't have them. - Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.69,1:09:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 胡扯！完全是胡扯 - 不 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bullshit. It's bullshit.- No I.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.20,1:09:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have any!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.40,1:09:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不知道？但是你却在帮忙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you don't know anything? You're just the help?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.87,1:09:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你住在装了安保系统的大房子里的原因 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you have the big house and the security clearance, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.64,1:09:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是他们要杀你的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why they're trying so hard to kill you,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.27,1:09:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你什么都不知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.64,1:09:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我的工作是科学研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know my job, which is science.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.24,1:09:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你们离开实验室做了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you do when you leave the lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.48,1:09:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们谁都不知道 - 整整4年\N{\fnArial\fs30}- None of us do! - For four years!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.11,1:09:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我要下车 求你把车停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I want to get out! Would you please stop the car?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.08,1:09:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可能那么傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be that naive.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.25,1:09:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你让我下车 - 你决不可能那么傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you let me out the car? - There's no way you're that naive!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.39,1:10:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想下车 请便吧 下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want out? Get out. Go on, get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.79,1:10:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有药丸 不知道它们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have any chems. You don't know where they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.43,1:10:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不知道 那么很好 滚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know anything. That's fine. Just get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.93,1:10:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经有个计划了 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you got a plan, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.60,1:10:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你当然有 你是个博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, of course you do. You're a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.93,1:10:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都难不住你 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got this all worked out, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.23,1:10:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来你要怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.34,1:10:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？你要怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.97,1:10:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人跑不掉 你不知道怎么逃命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't run, not alone. You don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.41,1:10:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逃不出他们的手掌心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You certainly can't hide.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.58,1:10:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有的是线索找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not from people like this, with the resources they have.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.34,1:10:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逃不过日落你还有什么选择？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't make it to sundown. So, what does that leave you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.35,1:10:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,公之于众？当然 你有发言权\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can go public, sure. You can go loud.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.82,1:10:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话给你妹 因为过去屡试不爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call your sister, because that worked out well for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.18,1:10:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,打给你前室友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call some ex-roommate.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.42,1:10:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,打给某个在华盛顿邮报工作的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call a guy that knows a guy at The Washington Post.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.19,1:10:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,放在网上？因为你知道你出卖了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it online. 'Cause you know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.26,1:10:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你能做到唯一计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}You blow me off, that's the only play you've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.96,1:10:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你最好先自问一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you'd better ask yourself this.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.29,1:10:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,以你发布消息的速度和广度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you ever say it loud enough or fast enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.10,1:10:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕还没发布之前就被他们挡下来了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they'd be too afraid to finish what they've started?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.10,1:10:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我有一个计划 虽然还不完善\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I've got a plan, and it's just not that complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.94,1:10:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要做的就是等待下一个杀你的人出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm going to do is wait for the next person to show up to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.18,1:10:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许他能帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they can help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.11,1:10:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 请便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, go for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.45,1:11:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没的选择 必须离开那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no choice. I had to get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.72,1:11:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我必须离开那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I had to get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.03,1:11:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没人 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, nobody. I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.96,1:11:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要明白 所有计划中的项目成果 那些实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to understand. All the work at Outcome, all those tests,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.57,1:11:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧伤恢复率 计量表 器官修复\N{\fnArial\fs30}the burn rates, dosage panels, tissue stress.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.97,1:11:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我们在做的一一调整配方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that is us tuning chemistry.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.24,1:11:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并不创造任何东西 都是自然产生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't fabricate anything. That happens downstream.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.04,1:11:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么意思？自然产生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What's that mean, "downstream"?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.48,1:11:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说你需要活体病毒来引导\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means you need live virus to seed adhesion.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.38,1:11:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,培养过程需要有高度活性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cultures are highly reactive.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.11,1:11:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须现场植入 所以不在实验室做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to process on-site and we would never do it here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.45,1:11:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 现场在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. On-site, where? Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.85,1:11:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我们把病毒保存在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we hold the virus?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.35,1:11:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.89,1:11:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 开车到不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we can't drive there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.22,1:11:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪里？ - 马尼拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is it? - Manila.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.26,1:11:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲律宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Philippines.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.72,1:12:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么忍受的了那些剂量？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you stand with your dosage?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.63,1:12:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有300毫克蓝药丸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have 300 milligrams of blues.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.86,1:12:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不够撑到明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not even enough for another day.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.13,1:12:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我已经超过51小时没服用绿色药丸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't had a full green in 51 hours,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.10,1:12:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是很奇怪 我还没感到体能下降\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is strange because I don't feel physically degraded.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.80,1:12:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我们想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.97,1:12:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.14,1:12:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚说你还在服用绿色药丸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just say you're still taking greens?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.41,1:12:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.74,1:12:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年你就不需要再吃体能药丸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were viraled off physical medication last year.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.61,1:12:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.14,1:12:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 他们8个月前用病毒感染了每个人 不用再吃绿药丸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus. They viraled everyone off greens eight months ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.28,1:12:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,用活体病毒感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}They infected you with live virus,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.75,1:12:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 身体上已经稳定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means that, physically, you're stable.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.25,1:12:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用再吃绿药丸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to take greens.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.12,1:12:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经稳定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They locked it in.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.42,1:12:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何… 任何身体上的增强都是永久性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any physical enhancement is now permanent.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.63,1:12:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你感染的我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you infected me?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.13,1:13:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候的事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was this?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.57,1:13:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我生病的时候？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this when I was sick?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.94,1:13:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那场说不清的流感？是因为你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mystery flu? That was you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.67,1:13:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 不是我 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it wasn't me. I didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.64,1:13:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你 你是故意的 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was you. That was on purpose, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.01,1:13:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I almost died.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.01,1:13:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 但不是因为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but it wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.78,1:13:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么我现在还在吃绿药丸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I still taking green pills, then?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.18,1:13:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 他们 我 我以为你已经停了药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I thought you had stopped.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.79,1:13:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么？我为什么还问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I asking you anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.99,1:13:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你一直牵制着我们 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or to keep us on a leash, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.36,1:13:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是？为了控制我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it? To keep a hold on us?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.16,1:13:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让我们产生依赖？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To keep us dependent?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.80,1:13:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁告诉你这样没有问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who tells you that this is Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.86,1:13:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我做过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one… I do…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.43,1:13:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说的没问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who says it's Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.50,1:13:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做过研究工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do research.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.54,1:13:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,设计实验 分析结果 但是我不监管药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I design, I survey. I don't administer meds.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.77,1:13:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不制定政策\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't make policy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.81,1:13:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你刚才给枪上了膛\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you just load the gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.54,1:13:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.28,1:13:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我在那儿做科学研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I was there for the science.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.18,1:13:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是做科学研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were all there for science.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.65,1:13:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不在意 但我作出了巨大的牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know you don't care, but I made a huge sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.22,1:14:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能公开 不能讨论\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't publish, I couldn't conference.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.89,1:14:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能跟任何人讲我的工作内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't tell a single person what it was I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.63,1:14:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我以为 我是在帮助我的国家 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I thought I was helping my country, and I know that's…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.23,1:14:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你是不是用病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you can viral off blues.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.64,1:14:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我去摆脱蓝药丸的依赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you viral off blues?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.04,1:14:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上讲 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theoretically, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.54,1:14:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.81,1:14:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 药物只允许暂时性的融合 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pills allow for temporary adhesion.- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.31,1:14:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要稳定下来 需要活体培养 活体病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}To lock it in, you need live culture. Live virus!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.68,1:14:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how to do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.05,1:14:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how to do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.08,1:14:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.55,1:14:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但是我说过了 它们在地球那一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but I told you, it's on the other side of the planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.69,1:14:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们要去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, guess where we're going?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.66,1:14:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到华盛顿 欢迎来到启明世贸大厦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Washington. Welcome to Candent World Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.57,1:14:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要确认在接下来的几天里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to make sure that over the next few days.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.53,1:14:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都有机会接触到造就斯特森·莫兰塔的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have a chance to connect with the people who have made Sterisyn Morlanta.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.94,1:14:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是启明集团公司的精英\N{\fnArial\fs30}the crown jewel in the Candent group of companies.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.67,1:14:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个月第三阶段的测试将得到批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Final Phase 3 testing approval is expected this month.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.74,1:14:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括镇静剂和抑制剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}for both reQuiel and Supressolyn.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.08,1:14:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很有信心 如期实现目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confidence is high that we're coming in on schedule, and we want to be ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.55,1:15:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道市场\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know the market is eager.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.15,1:15:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也知道全球化 和\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know, globally, the kind of…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.06,1:15:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼为什么我不知道这些？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell don't I know about this?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.59,1:15:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在指控我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're directing that at me?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.66,1:15:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们派了一支D队过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a D-Trac team we sent in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.06,1:15:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.13,1:15:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说他们是这方面的佼佼者\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means they're good at what they do.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.30,1:15:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我听说他们都失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was told that they were missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.60,1:15:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't just go missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.53,1:15:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不给我们讲讲这个女人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What didn't you tell us about this woman?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.24,1:15:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好讲的 她就是她而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. She is who she is. There's nothing to tell.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.30,1:15:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,要她怎样就怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You vetted her up and down.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.77,1:15:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们究竟知道什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what the hell are we looking at?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.11,1:15:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有把注册的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has a registered gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.81,1:15:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}They knew that going in.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.98,1:15:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有通行证\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got building permits.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.55,1:15:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,丙烷 焊接罐 流弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Propane, welding tanks. A stray bullet?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.11,1:15:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还继续猜下去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to keep guessing?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.32,1:15:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要过去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to get in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.48,1:15:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,周围有12人待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a dozen people waiting on the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.59,1:15:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没控制现场？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't control the site?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.72,1:15:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.92,1:15:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在了解情况了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting the picture now?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.06,1:15:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.22,1:15:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里我没法处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't run this from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.49,1:15:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要进行全面搜查 我要所有相关团队和通讯设施\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a crisis suite. I need integrated grids and comms.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.96,1:15:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need all of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.03,1:15:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇航局 五角大楼或者自由女神像\N{\fnArial\fs30}NSA, or Pentagon, or Liberty Crossing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.96,1:15:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管是什么 都要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care, just get me something now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.03,1:15:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿上衣服 开上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack up your codes and your drives,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.60,1:15:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点准备就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and whatever else you're going to need.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.80,1:15:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要马上行动 守在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to move and we're going to stay there.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.27,1:15:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对那所房子彻底布控 周围都是当地平民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dita, how am I putting a net over that house? There's locals all over it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.07,1:15:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来查病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go with germs.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.94,1:16:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把实验室中的样本带走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took samples from work.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.24,1:16:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,病原体 病毒 这可是国土安全问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pathogens, viruses. It's national security.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.41,1:16:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 低调行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, Okay, I like that, it plays.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.95,1:16:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快行动去吧 快行动去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, get it out there, get it out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.42,1:16:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 每个人再拿一样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go, let's go. Everybody find another gear, Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.18,1:16:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们20秒内离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I want to be out of here in 20.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.82,1:16:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说你想改变人体\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, let's say you want to change the human body.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.36,1:16:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,修复错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to fix a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.86,1:16:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想弥补什么 增强什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to repair something, improve something.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.50,1:16:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你将人类基因进行重组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you're going to reprogram human genetic material,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.30,1:16:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要一个传送系统 病毒最好不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}you need a delivery system, and nothing works better than virus.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.94,1:16:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点像旅行箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a suitcase.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.34,1:16:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把基因打包\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pack in genetic mutation,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.51,1:16:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,感染人体 病毒会将之输送到目标细胞中\N{\fnArial\fs30}infect the body and the vector unloads into the target cells.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.88,1:16:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如何到达你想要的地方 怎么做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But getting it where you want it, how you want it,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.12,1:16:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直就是噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.28,1:16:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你有张图谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you have a map.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.29,1:16:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,1985年德特里克堡发生过一起严重事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this terrible accident at Fort Detrick in 1985.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.46,1:16:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,5名研究员在实验室中死亡 就是因此产生的灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five researchers dropped dead in the lab, and it was such a catastrophe.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.83,1:16:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们从斯坦福把丹·希尔科\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they brought in Dan Hillcott.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.30,1:16:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,调了过去评估损失情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Stanford to assess the damage.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.17,1:17:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他到了那儿意识到 这件事使他在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got in there and he realized that, underneath it all,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.71,1:17:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,病毒受体图谱绘制方面有了重大突破\N{\fnArial\fs30}was this incredible breakthrough in viral-receptor mapping.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.58,1:17:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他绘制了图谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a map.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.38,1:17:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上有一些不同染色体的细微改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've had some very minor alterations.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.48,1:17:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上有一些不同染色体的细微改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}made to two different chromosomes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.39,1:17:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿色部分 身体部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}The green side, the physical side,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.39,1:17:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是1.5%的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is nothing more than a 1.5 percent rise.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.59,1:17:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的线粒体蛋白含量\N{\fnArial\fs30}in your mitochondrial protein uptake.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.36,1:17:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过增加了1.5%\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with 1.5 percent,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.26,1:17:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你的细胞分裂速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}you see this immediate increase in cellular tempo,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.77,1:17:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,肌肉韧性和氧合作用大幅增加\N{\fnArial\fs30}muscle efficiency, oxygenation…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.70,1:17:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在蓝色部分？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the blue side?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.87,1:17:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,智力 很明显 但不至于次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intelligence, obviously, but it's more than that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.31,1:17:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,神经再生 敏捷度\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's neural regeneration and elasticity.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.74,1:17:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,感应功能 痛苦抑制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sensory function. Pain suppression.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.61,1:17:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是令人兴奋的进步\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the most exciting development in genomic targeting.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.38,1:17:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在科学史上的染色体标记方面\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the history of the science.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.47,1:18:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.78,1:18:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 怎么把71号监控器显示在大屏幕上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how do I get monitor 71 up on the big screen?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.05,1:18:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming up.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.26,1:18:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们发现一具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found a body.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.59,1:18:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认是女性 但肯定不是玛塔·希林\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're pretty sure it's a woman, and it's not Marta Shearing.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.29,1:18:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们发现了身份牌子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found dog tags.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.83,1:18:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认为他被枪杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think she was shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.01,1:18:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.45,1:18:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.45,1:18:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛塔 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marta, I…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.15,1:18:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能打给任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't call anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.93,1:19:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是关心你 认为你已经死了的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are people that care about you that think you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.96,1:19:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对此你无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's nothing you can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.53,1:19:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你联系的任何人都会成为目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone you contact becomes a target.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.20,1:19:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要放得下任何正常的情感\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you need to put aside any normal emotional response that you have.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.48,1:19:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在最大的优势 就是他们认为我们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only edge we've got right now is they think we're both gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.51,1:19:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.78,1:19:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.22,1:19:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.02,1:19:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你实在是放不下\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're going to want to go through this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.47,1:19:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,多熟悉熟悉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, just be familiar with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.65,1:20:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼·梦露\N{\fnArial\fs30}June Monroe.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.42,1:20:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是琼·梦露？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is June Monroe?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.32,1:20:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.69,1:20:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know her?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.57,1:20:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not any more.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.88,1:20:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你要让自己强大起来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you have to stay enhanced?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.28,1:20:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这对你如此重要？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it so important to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.32,1:20:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.71,1:21:03.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（陨落的英雄 纪念那些死去的人）
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.95,1:21:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.42,1:21:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是曾经的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.12,1:21:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.66,1:21:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的应征官\N{\fnArial\fs30}My army recruiter.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.23,1:21:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为了完成分配的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}was looking to make his quota.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.60,1:21:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我的智商多加了12点\N{\fnArial\fs30}He added 12 points to my IQ.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.60,1:21:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,加12分才达到最低标准线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelve points to make the minimum.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.32,1:21:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过智力低下的人吗 玛塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever seen a cognitive degrade, Marta?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.92,1:21:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,反应迟钝的呢 见过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sensory withdrawal? You ever do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.32,1:21:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,将蓝色的药停掉看他们的反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull someone's blues and watch them drop off their meds?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.76,1:21:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.46,1:21:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是描绘一幅美丽的梦中图画\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they paint a pretty graphic picture in training.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.60,1:21:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,和现实有落差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell of a long way to fall.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.20,1:22:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你不打起精神 我们熬不过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can't keep it together, we won't make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.52,1:22:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们做了这些 - 谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They bit. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.98,1:22:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,华盛顿邮报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Washington Post.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.69,1:22:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚截获的邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just flagged an email.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.82,1:22:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们略有耳闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going with the story about the possible theft.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.06,1:22:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验危险物质遭窃事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the dangerous materials from the lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.96,1:22:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真信了 他们已经认定是酒驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, they took it. They already flagged a DWI conviction.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.30,1:22:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下更省事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's convenient.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.53,1:22:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现了另一具尸体 我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found another body. One of ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.50,1:22:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在那儿回收一地的子弹壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're picking up shell casings all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.34,1:22:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你的博士已经不在那儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think your doctor's in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.09,1:23:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,请出示身份证和登机证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boarding pass and ID, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.43,1:23:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.94,1:23:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,请出示身份证和登机证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boarding pass and ID, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.88,1:23:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.38,1:23:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在你身后 别转身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right behind you. Don't turn around.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.59,1:23:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就呆在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to stay right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.79,1:24:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到登机 好吗？你做的很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}until it's time to board, Okay? You're doing great.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.16,1:24:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你右边的通道了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that corridor on your right?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.56,1:24:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现有人走那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna want to find somebody.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.73,1:24:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着那人走就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's walking that way and just tag along.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.06,1:24:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直走 低着头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving, keep your head down,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.47,1:24:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机上见\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll see you on the plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.00,1:24:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.40,1:24:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.34,1:24:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,痕迹很清晰 刚留下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trail is definitive and fresh.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.51,1:24:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,警犬从她家追踪到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}The canine team tracked her from her house.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.58,1:24:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过这片林地 然后是这儿 在这个停车场\N{\fnArial\fs30}through this wooded area, ending here, at this little parking lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.75,1:24:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么是她在那边有辆车 要么就是有人开车接应她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either she had a car waiting for her, or somebody picked her up.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.79,1:24:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,街上的监控显示那儿什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are security cameras on the street, but there's nothing back here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.59,1:24:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有卫星监控图\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be satellite footage.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.36,1:24:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,马里兰州不是美国的高危进攻目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maryland's not exactly a high-value U.S. target.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.79,1:24:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有不少卫星云图\N{\fnArial\fs30}There'll be plenty of weather imaging,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.16,1:24:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能看个大概\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we're gonna have to swing a little wider.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.36,1:24:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能看实时画面\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find something real-time that's enhanceable.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.73,1:24:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要筛选一些国外监控 这差不多要一小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're draining some foreign platforms. We need about an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.97,1:24:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧 她一个人怎么能做的这么缜密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, she's not pulling this off on her own.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.17,1:24:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在帮她呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell is helping her?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.74,1:24:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找到要在1小时外\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find out more in the next hour,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.38,1:24:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,会发现 我们目前当然在\N{\fnArial\fs30}while we are currently in court.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.98,1:24:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来 Jen\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now back to Jenn.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.48,1:25:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,FBI今早已证实阿尔伯特·赫希博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The FBI this morning confirmed reports that Dr. Albert Hirsch.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.19,1:25:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在华盛顿一家旅馆里死于心脏病\N{\fnArial\fs30}died of heart failure in a Washington, D. C. hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.66,1:25:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫希博士有望在昨天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Hirsch had been expected to testify yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.69,1:25:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,向特工委员会做证实报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}before a Senate Intelligence committee.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.59,1:25:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,委员会正在调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}That select committee is investigating links.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.16,1:25:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,CIA问题频出的绊脚石计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}between a troubled CIA program known as Treadstone.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.70,1:25:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是否与杰森·伯恩此人相关\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this man, Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.53,1:25:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察和联邦人员正在调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police and federal officials are searching for Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.27,1:25:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,此案是否与近期纽约和伦敦发生的枪击案有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}in connection with recent shootings in New York and in London.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.61,1:25:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫希博士一直希望与司法部门进行合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Hirsch had been cooperating with the Justice Department.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.51,1:25:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,悲剧发生时他正处在证人保护监控中\N{\fnArial\fs30}and was in protective custody at the time of the incident.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.61,1:25:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚一名委员会发言人告诉记者\N{\fnArial\fs30}A committee spokesman told reporters last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.45,1:25:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,听证会暂时推迟\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the hearings will be postponed temporarily.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.45,1:25:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为正在调查博士的死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}as they evaluate the loss of Doctor…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.46,1:25:53.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（研究员混乱的过去让实验室调查疑云重重）
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.51,1:26:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, folks.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.58,1:26:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是提醒你们 保持这里的过道通畅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just going to remind you to keep the aisles clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.38,1:26:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在起飞和着陆时\N{\fnArial\fs30}for any baggage during takeoff and landing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.88,1:26:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 借过 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.78,1:26:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.22,1:26:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 要帮您找座位吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, do you need help finding your seat?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.93,1:26:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生 - 不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir? - No, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.68,1:26:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那两个阴影了？其中一个是她 那就是停车场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see those two shadows? One of them is her. That's the parking lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.98,1:26:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个停下了 车来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them stops. Here comes the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.69,1:26:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这录像哪来的？ - 加拿大森林卫星\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is this from? - It's a Canadian forestry satellite.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.35,1:26:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 然后另一个人上了车 在这儿 然后他们走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here comes the other one into the car, and there they go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.49,1:26:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪里？- 我们跟丢了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - We lose them east.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.19,1:26:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,公路以外2公里无法监控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our window drops out about two miles up the road.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.53,1:26:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们有个大致轮廓\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we've got the silhouette.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.96,1:26:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有道路监控录像 可以马上看\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got surveillance footage, racked and ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.10,1:26:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分组查找这辆车 绘制他们的行动轨迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to split teams, find this car and link up atrail.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.04,1:27:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,要持续17小时？\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a 17-hour head start?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.60,1:27:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还能跑到哪儿去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell can she go?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.35,1:27:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在找一辆新的别克LeSabre 2000型\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for a Buick LeSabre 2002.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.02,1:27:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有国家情报局和国家安全局的搜查令 这就是原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got an NIA/Homeland warrant, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.39,1:27:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能给我你们那儿的信息么？- 2位乘客\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, you give us what you have… - Two passengers.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.39,1:27:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一辆02年产的紫红色LeSabre 从马里兰州里斯本向西行驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an '02 burgundy LeSabre starting west from Lisbon, Maryland.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.53,1:27:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,便利店 服务站 加油站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tolls, exits, service stations.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.70,1:27:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我所有你有的监控录像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me every camera you've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.54,1:27:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边能看到FBI的监控影像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm seeing an FBI camera bin on my list here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.81,1:27:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 只要交通的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Traffic only.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.14,1:27:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,里斯本 L-I-S-B-O-N\N{\fnArial\fs30}West, Lisbon. L-I-S-B-O-N.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.41,1:27:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们都要 所有监控录像 什么都要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we want all of that and the toll cams. We want everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.85,1:27:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全要 不管你们有什么 都传送过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take them all. Whatever hits you have, send them on.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.42,1:27:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会做分类处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will work on sorting them out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.41,1:28:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在威尔明顿 特拉华州发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wilmington, Delaware.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.31,1:28:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们要的车 这辆LeSabre 它向这个建筑驶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our car, the LeSabre. We see it coming into the structure.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.52,1:28:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,向下开 转个弯 在这里面停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}It goes under, comes back around, and it parks here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.49,1:28:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就没出来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it doesn't come out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.15,1:28:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是车进去前4分钟的内部影像\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is inside. It's four minutes after arrival.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.06,1:28:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's her.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.19,1:28:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知不知道她要做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we know what she's doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.26,1:28:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在拍护照照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was having her passport picture taken.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.61,1:28:42.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（菲律宾 马尼拉）
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.64,1:28:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛根 哈特福德 拉瓜迪亚 肯尼迪 费城 纽华克机场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan, Hartford, LaGuardia, Kennedy, Philly, Newark,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.38,1:28:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜勒斯机场 里根机场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dulles, Reagan.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.01,1:28:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始发布通缉警告 那就是我们要找的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We start with yesterday morning, that is our wedge.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.51,1:28:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,说清楚 然后按计划行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We clear that, and then we move up the clock.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.36,1:29:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她问要不要哈特福德机场的 她可以拿到记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants to know if you want Hartford, because she can get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.36,1:29:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝外套 第二排 她带了个红色的包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue coat, second row. She's got a red bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.60,1:29:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪一个 我有4个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one? I have four.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.70,1:29:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有4个运输安全局授权授权1 6 9 12号\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I have TSA Authorization 1, 6, 9 and 12.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.60,1:29:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,以上机场 所有部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Airports given, all departures.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.61,1:29:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 首先查国际航班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, the international terminal first.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.19,1:30:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上到啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.03,1:30:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查一下报亭\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, check out the newsstand.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.20,1:30:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.36,1:30:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.23,1:30:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛根机场有一张面孔你应该看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan has a face we need to look at, but there's kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.30,1:30:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 停下 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, hang on, hang on. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.37,1:30:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.11,1:30:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.28,1:30:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 肯尼迪机场 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kennedy. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.49,1:30:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未在晚上来过 不知道有什么规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been here at night. I don't know the rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.00,1:30:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么规矩 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no rules, Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.23,1:30:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你属于这儿 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We belong here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.77,1:30:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.68,1:31:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.91,1:31:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,希林博士和我来这儿 请打开实验室大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Shearing and I are here to open up the lab, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.42,1:31:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官 - 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir? - What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.48,1:31:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.92,1:31:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,希林博士 希林博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Shearing! Dr. Shearing.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.69,1:31:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 约瑟夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's me, Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.96,1:31:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,约瑟夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joseph!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.13,1:31:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 近来如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.60,1:31:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.33,1:31:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎回来 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Welcome back. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.60,1:31:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 接待名单上没有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I just don't have you on my list arriving.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.17,1:31:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们改了日程\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because we had to change our schedule.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.27,1:31:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们坐了早一班的飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we took an earlier flight.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.97,1:31:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,约瑟夫 我是布伦戴奇医生 见到你很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joseph, I'm Dr. Brundage, by the way. It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.21,1:31:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你也很高兴 但是可普马洛医生不在这儿 他去了新加坡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleased to meet you, too, but Dr. Pumaloy is not here, he went to Singapore.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.28,1:31:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天刚走\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just left yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.88,1:31:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为您回家了 没人告诉我您会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girls have gone home. No one told me anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.18,1:31:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 嗯 我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Well, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.65,1:31:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要在这儿呆一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look, we're going to be here all week,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.36,1:31:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多事情要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we have a lot of work to do,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.86,1:31:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以每晚都会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we need to get in there tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.33,1:31:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以赶快开始吧 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get things started, Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.53,1:31:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 当然 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, of course, it's just that…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.33,1:31:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你愿意你可以打电话给可普马洛博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can call Dr. Pumaloy if you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.03,1:31:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没逼你这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't want to put you on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.30,1:31:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we don't have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.80,1:31:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, great.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.47,1:32:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是你们俩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just the two of you?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.47,1:32:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.58,1:32:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.51,1:32:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.58,1:32:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I will hold.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.02,1:32:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个放到大屏幕上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it up there. Put that up on the big screen.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.19,1:32:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.66,1:32:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.06,1:32:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一份旅客名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need an immediate upload on that passenger manifest.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.03,1:32:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道她在名单上 我会让她接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Here she is, I'm putting her back on.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.33,1:32:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尼拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manila.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.12,1:32:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她乘美国167号航班去马尼拉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took American 167 to Manila.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.67,1:32:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,45分钟前着陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}She landed 45 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.48,1:33:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.31,1:33:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.83,1:33:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有243名乘客在那次航班上\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's 243 people on that plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.00,1:33:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要立刻辨认每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to scope every one of them right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.00,1:33:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果发现任何一张熟悉的脸 点击出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, pick a face that you like, pull it down,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.27,1:33:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的没问题再关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}and deselect it if you've cleared it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.00,1:33:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,若有任何你觉得不对劲的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there is anything that smells wrong to you,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.91,1:33:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是蛛丝马迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}if there's a hair out of place that you don't like,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.27,1:33:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要放过\N{\fnArial\fs30}you do not clear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.48,1:33:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,做上标记 发过来 我们会做辨认\N{\fnArial\fs30}You flag it and you send it over to Dita and we'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.01,1:33:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要对同样的网格进行筛选 就是国土安全9 5\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to be working off the same grid. That's Homeland 9.5.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.68,1:33:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们没有访问权 请举手\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't pull that access, raise your hand,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.12,1:33:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈迪上校会帮你解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel Hardy's going to come over and sort you out.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.83,1:34:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.27,1:34:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.71,1:34:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.71,1:34:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们究竟在查什么 特里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are we into, Terry?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.44,1:34:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.78,1:34:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的工厂 你们在那儿做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your shop. What is going on over there?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.61,1:34:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没听到我说的吗？我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I say? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.98,1:34:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一共去过那里几次？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how many trips has she made over there?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.78,1:34:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,5 6次 我不清楚 为什么是菲律宾？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five, six, I don't know. Why the Philippines?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.68,1:34:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.19,1:34:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,座位13B 卡尔·T·布伦戴奇 13B\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seat 13-B. Karl D. Brundage, 13-B.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.16,1:34:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有协助人员都离开房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need support staff to clear the room.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.60,1:34:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来都出去 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand up and walk, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.14,1:34:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去 快 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, Cathy, move! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.51,1:34:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他究竟是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.18,1:35:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是成果计划的特工人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an Outcome agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.32,1:35:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,特工5号\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Outcome 5.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.49,1:35:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还没死？我以为他们都死光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not dead? I thought they were dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.16,1:35:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 他本应该已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's supposed to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.99,1:35:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那他在那儿做什么？- 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then what's he doing there? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.93,1:35:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在找药丸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's looking for meds.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.40,1:35:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.56,1:35:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,药品都是那里生产的 不然他去那儿做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where the chems come from. What else would he be doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.07,1:35:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定是在帮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got to be helping him.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.60,1:35:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么去的？怎么可能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how? How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.27,1:35:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 也不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.27,1:35:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着 他们在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's alive, they're there.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.11,1:35:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么已经无关紧要了 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"How" doesn't really matter, does it?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.58,1:35:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在唯一的任务 就是要彻底干掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only mission we've got now is to drop a bag over this.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.61,1:35:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要找的药丸不在那儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are the drugs he's looking for there, or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.45,1:35:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我必须 特里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, I don't… Terry?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.02,1:35:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 那儿什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, there's nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.59,1:35:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府已经接管了16周\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't made a run in 16 weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.05,1:35:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们也不可能保存什么药品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, we wouldn't store the pills there, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.72,1:35:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里基本上就是个加工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's basically a kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.06,1:35:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们提供药方 在需要的时候加工生产一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tweak the recipe and we bake up a batch when we need it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.29,1:35:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们去那儿做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what the hell are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.76,1:35:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,病毒在那儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stems are there.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.63,1:35:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定是帮他用病毒治病\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's going to try to viral him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.97,1:36:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.41,1:36:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mack. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.99,1:36:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,车间办公室 我是马克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plant office, Mackie speaking.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.92,1:36:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克 我是特伦斯·沃德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Mackie, this is Terrance Ward.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.42,1:36:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是启明集团的副主席\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the Senior Vice-President for Candent Precision Metrics.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.79,1:36:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是从马里兰打来的电话 是的 - 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm calling from Maryland. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.13,1:36:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有一个潜在的安全威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a potential security incident.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.26,1:36:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在公司网站上发布了两张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just posted two photographs on the company network.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.67,1:36:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道是不是这两人试着闯进\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know if either of these two people have tried to enter…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.03,1:37:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我们在调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.80,1:37:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.87,1:37:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在查 我们正在想应该给谁打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're on the case. We're just here now trying to figure out who to call.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.01,1:37:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的门卫接待了两位医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our gatehouse just passed in two doctors.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.31,1:37:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想其中一人自称希林博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think one of them might be that woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.71,1:37:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪击案中的女博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}from your shoot-out over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.15,1:37:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们现在在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, where are they now?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.65,1:37:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有的重要实验室都在楼下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We keep all of our client labs downstairs,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.62,1:37:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我认为他们去了地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we're assuming they've gone into the basement.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.95,1:37:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚派了人去查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just sent a couple of boys down to check it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.85,1:37:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 把你的人撤回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. No, no, withdraw your team.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.19,1:37:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁上地下室 把他们关在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock the lab and keep them down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.32,1:37:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别试着抓他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not try to take him.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.40,1:37:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.57,1:37:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你干什么呢？需要帮助吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how you doing? Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.47,1:37:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们单独在这儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you alone down here?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.64,1:37:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.07,1:37:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.64,1:37:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不能到这里来 你们有这个等级授权吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be down here. Do you have clearance for this level?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.87,1:37:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人都不该到下面来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's supposed to be down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.94,1:37:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以到这里来 我是希林博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to be down here. I'm Dr. Shearing.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.94,1:37:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在做采样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in the middle of a sampling audit.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.38,1:37:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在这里不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not safe for you guys to be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.51,1:37:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,请跟我们上楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's straighten this out upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.98,1:37:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别碰我 - 收拾好 我们上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't touch that. - Pack it up, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.48,1:37:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着 别碰那个 - 跟我们上楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, nobody touch anything. - Come on, just follow us.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.05,1:37:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想跟你们争吵 我要给你们老板打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to sit here and argue with you. I'm going to call your boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.59,1:37:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们会消除误会的 - 看着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and we're gonna figure it out.- Watch her.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.19,1:37:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.91,1:38:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去拿包 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to get my bag. We got to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.38,1:38:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.45,1:38:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.42,1:38:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道这通向哪里 - 开开就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know where this goes. - Just open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.06,1:38:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,往后站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step back.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.07,1:38:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,关门 嘿 说你呢 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock it down. Hey! You! You! With me! Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.21,1:38:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这儿关了么？ - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that locked? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.72,1:38:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许有人进出 懂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one in, no one out. Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.32,1:38:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我们在严格监控下 你待在楼下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what happened to those three guys you sent downstairs?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.92,1:38:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.16,1:39:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去看看 你呆着别走 明白？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me. You stay there, Okay? Stay there.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.99,1:39:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是属于这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We belong here.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.07,1:39:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming through.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.69,1:39:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 去把其他人喊来 告诉他们到门口去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, go and get everyone else. Tell them to go around the front.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.13,1:39:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去东门 然后绕到前门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go through the eastern doors, move around the front.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.04,1:39:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点 大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move, people!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.74,1:39:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个无线电是谁的 怎么没人回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who have you got on this radio? Why is no one responding?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.18,1:39:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,门关了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that gate shut?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.45,1:39:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.88,1:40:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得关上门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! I need that gate shut!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.78,1:40:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你 听着 去正门 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you! Listen, go down to the main gate. Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.95,1:40:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许有人进出\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one in, no one out.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.55,1:40:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你在干啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.86,1:40:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,和其他人一样排队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get down to the main gate with everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.66,1:40:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退 后退 让一让\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, get back! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.86,1:40:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他点空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him some room.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.96,1:40:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 让一让 让一让\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, give me some room. Give me some room, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.97,1:40:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 他需要看医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going to need a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.74,1:40:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,保安？保安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security. Security!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.91,1:40:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,请到这边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.74,1:40:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.58,1:40:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 你能听到我说话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, can you hear me? Sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.09,1:40:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跑不远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't get far.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.72,1:40:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他不能用病毒治疗 他肯定坚持不住\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he didn't viral out, he's going to run out of brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.19,1:40:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他用病毒治疗 会变得太虚弱走不动路\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, if he did, then he's going to be too sick to move.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.46,1:40:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们只要尽快找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we just have to find him fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.23,1:40:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他了事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and kill him, once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.07,1:40:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在可以提拉斯计划了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we talk about LARX?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.87,1:40:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉斯计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}LARX?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.40,1:40:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉斯3号在曼谷 大概2小时航程\N{\fnArial\fs30}LARX-3 is in Bangkok. It's atwo-hour flight.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.77,1:40:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 先等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Just hang on, here.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.94,1:41:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为那只是个提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that was just a proposal.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.21,1:41:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,派他过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.48,1:41:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉斯是增强版备用计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}LARX is a beta-Z stem program.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.29,1:41:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对忠诚于任务 冷血无情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amped mission fidelity, minimized empathy.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.95,1:41:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是比绊脚石计划更稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Treadstone without the inconsistency,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.42,1:41:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,比成果计划更没有情感漏洞的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outcome without the emotional noise.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.93,1:41:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看起来非常强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's looking very strong for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.73,1:41:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从未见过像这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have never seen evaluations like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.10,1:41:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个计划我不知情\N{\fnArial\fs30}This went from something I don't know about.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.37,1:41:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是纸上谈兵的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}to something on the drawing board,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.77,1:41:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你却告诉我它正良好运行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now you're telling me it's up and running?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.80,1:41:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实在良好运行 现在你已经知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up and running. Consider yourself informed.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.72,1:42:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you comfortable?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.52,1:42:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.86,1:42:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来不太舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't look comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.00,1:42:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.07,1:42:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.10,1:42:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯尼斯·詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kenneth James.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.57,1:42:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,全名 肯尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full name, Kenneth.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.44,1:42:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kenneth… James…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.78,1:42:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kitsom.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.91,1:42:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have a room.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.95,1:42:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能走路吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you walk?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.85,1:42:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 可以 我想可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Yeah. Yeah. I think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.10,1:43:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪儿来？肯尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you from, Kenneth?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.31,1:43:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.64,1:43:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你报名之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you enlisted.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.04,1:43:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Berwin.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.08,1:43:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是座城镇么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a town?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.88,1:43:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个州的首府\N{\fnArial\fs30}Berwin… It's a state home.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.48,1:43:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个州？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What state?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.92,1:43:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,里诺州\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Reno.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.79,1:43:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个测试？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a test?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.92,1:43:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.33,1:43:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我通过了就能留下来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I pass, can I stay here?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.47,1:43:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想留下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to stay?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.54,1:43:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.94,1:43:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.72,1:43:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.42,1:44:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 呆着别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, just lie still.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.36,1:44:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦 你得 艾伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron, you have… Aaron…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.53,1:44:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.37,1:44:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有四万美元 在我夹克衬里里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's $40, 000 in the lining of my jacket.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.78,1:44:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个包里有护照\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this bag, there are passports.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.61,1:44:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个空白的 三张假身份 还有个手表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two blanks and three ghosts, there's that guy's watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.88,1:44:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有些其他的东西 ？你拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are other things, Okay? You take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.32,1:44:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.62,1:44:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能熬过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.99,1:44:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.66,1:44:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能熬过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.53,1:44:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,低调行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Stay small.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.73,1:44:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要坐飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}No airports.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.33,1:44:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,融入人群里消失 你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just blend in like you know, Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.31,1:44:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为我做的已经够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.48,1:44:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.18,1:44:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你离开吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please go.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.71,1:44:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经为我做的够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.76,1:45:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's in the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.89,1:46:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个测试？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a test?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.22,1:46:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.39,1:46:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我通过了就能留下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I pass, can I stay here?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.99,1:46:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想留下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to stay?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.44,1:46:54.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（出去买药了）
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.50,1:46:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,扑热息痛 500mg\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paracetamol, 500 milligrams.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.77,1:47:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,一天四次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four times a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.78,1:47:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,免费的 这是免费的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For free. This is free.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.14,1:47:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, good.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.55,1:47:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.30,1:48:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.34,1:49:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Where are you?"
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.41,1:49:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是信号吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Was that the signal?"
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.48,1:49:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们请求确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're asking for confirmation.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.95,1:49:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去太早了 不 我们去太早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You went too soon." No… "We went too soon."
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.65,1:49:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.89,1:51:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.63,1:51:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察 警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police! Police!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.07,1:52:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.95,1:52:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.18,1:52:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.92,1:52:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.34,1:53:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down, get down.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.35,1:53:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 爬上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Climb over.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.68,1:53:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 爬过去 爬过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Get over, get over, get over.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.55,1:53:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬过去 抓紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over. Hang on tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.22,1:53:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.89,1:53:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了？松手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready? Let go!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.92,1:54:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 拿上这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.09,1:54:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走 别回头 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep walking, don't look back. Go, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.42,1:54:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey. Get on.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.43,1:54:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你从没骑过这个？ - 没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ever ridden before? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.73,1:54:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.83,1:54:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察 警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police, police!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.10,1:54:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧 抓着我 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on tight and follow me, Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.17,1:54:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.36,1:55:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.51,1:55:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,低头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your head down.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.91,1:55:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.97,1:56:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.76,2:00:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你中枪了？- 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've been shot. - It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.93,2:00:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull over!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.33,2:00:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull over.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.53,2:00:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,得去找点水\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just have to get to the water.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.97,2:00:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you check that for me?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.07,2:00:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,要多长时间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long is that going to take?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.54,2:00:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.64,2:00:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会回复你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get back to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.54,2:00:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有进展？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.01,2:00:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.88,2:00:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察们都被甩掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cops are out.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.04,2:00:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们跟丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They lost the trail.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.79,2:00:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:26.00,2:01:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦 亚伦 亚伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron! Aaron! Aaron! Aaron!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.92,2:01:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you Okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.46,2:01:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you Okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.79,2:01:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:15.65,2:02:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,能帮帮我们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you help us?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.29,2:02:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.26,2:02:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在应该有消息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should be up there now.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.27,2:02:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们过夜的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said it's the room where they spent the night.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.33,2:02:50.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（到此为止）
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.32,2:02:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,六年前我们的绊脚石计划出现了问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we had a problem with Treadstone six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.02,2:02:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑石楠计划也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Blackbriar program,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.79,2:03:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你面前的就是这些行动的详细计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}detailed in the operations report you have before you,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.96,2:03:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动这个计划仅仅是为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}was activated solely to capture.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.96,2:03:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮捕一个失控的绊脚石计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}a Treadstone operative gone rogue.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.53,2:03:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕姆 你会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pam, what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.80,2:03:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,无可奉告\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have nothing for you now.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:10.50,2:03:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道帕梅拉·兰迪为什么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know Pamela Landy's reasons.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:12.31,2:03:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,反法律 帮助与国家为敌的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}for criminally assisting an enemy of the United States.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:15.14,2:03:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事实是 她没有行动权限\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the fact is, she lacked the operational clearance.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.01,2:03:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,更不用说接触到\N{\fnArial\fs30}to access, much less interpret, the information you have.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:23.15,2:03:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些摆在你们面前的机密文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the classified file before you.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.62,2:03:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕姆 有传言说你被起诉 这真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pam, there's a rumor that you're going to be indicted, is it true?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:26.99,2:03:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马克 对此有何评论？- 你收到传讯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mike, can you comment? - Have you been subpoenaed?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.56,2:03:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是自愿来的 我们来参与会议的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here voluntarily. We came for a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:30.29,2:03:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否还在与杰森·伯恩吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you had any contact with Jason Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:31.69,2:03:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你收到法院传单了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you receive a target letter or not?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.29,2:03:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要看到明天吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we going to see you tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.56,2:03:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢上帝 她翅膀还不是太硬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thank God that there were hands steady enough.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.73,2:03:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在造成进一步不良影响之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make sure that the documents she tried to shop to the press.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:40.30,2:03:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,要确保这些她即将公布给媒体\N{\fnArial\fs30}were contained before they could.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.04,2:03:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,的文件被严格控制住\N{\fnArial\fs30}do any more harm than they already have.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.67,2:03:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还会如期出现在众议会特勤委员会么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still scheduled to appear at the House Intelligence Committee?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:46.47,2:03:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 其他事情找我律师谈 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am. Look, anything else is going to have to come from my attorneys, Okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.41,2:03:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对之前的陈述后悔吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you regret your earlier statement?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.08,2:03:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对很多事情后悔 但这件不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I regret a lot of things. I'm not sure that one is on the list.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.98,2:03:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, guys.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.73,2:04:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.90,2:04:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.57,2:04:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们迷路了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we lost?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:54.14,2:04:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.58,2:04:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看还有什么选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just looking at our options.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:02.75,2:05:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是希望我们迷路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was kind of hoping we were lost.
